  "description": "The TK1 Folding Electric Trike has been replaced by the TK2 Folding Electric Trike\nThe TK2 is the direct successor to the TK1 Folding. It keeps the folding frame and the 450 lb payload, and adds hydraulic disc brakes, a rear differential for steadier cornering, a reverse gear, and a larger 48V 15Ah (720 Wh) battery. The TK1 is no longer available to order.\nSee the TK2 Folding Electric Trike → Compare all electric trikes\nThe TK1 Folding Electric Trike perfectly combines value and practicality. With a range of 35 to 70 miles and a weight capacity of 450 lbs, its folding design and near-completely assembled structure ensure both safety and convenience, making it the ideal choice for short commutes and everyday rides.",
